    <string name="tuning_gesture_blocked_body">The system refused the last gesture. Try a different app, or use the in-app preview to confirm the mapping is correct.</string>
    <string name="tuning_fireos_title">Accessibility is restricted on this Fire OS build</string>
    <string name="tuning_fireos_body">This Fire OS version restricts third-party accessibility services. Mapping outside PulsePad is unavailable on this device. You can still use PulsePad as a 3D configuration preview.</string>
    <string name="tuning_interval_warning">Intervals below 32 ms increase CPU use and battery drain, and rarely improve perceived latency.</string>

